flowchart TD
    A([User opens Schedules page]) --> B[View schedule list]
    B --> C{Has schedules?}
    C -->|No| D[Empty state message]
    C -->|Yes| E[Schedule table with status badges]

    D --> F[Click 'New Schedule']
    E --> F

    F --> G[Fill form: name, cron, type, filters]
    G --> H[Click cron preset or type manually]
    H --> I[Submit form]

    I --> J{Valid cron?}
    J -->|No| K[Show validation error]
    K --> G

    J -->|Yes| L[API creates schedule + registers with APScheduler]
    L --> M[Schedule appears in table as Active]

    M --> N{Time passes...}
    N --> O[APScheduler fires CronTrigger]
    O --> P[_execute_scheduled_scan callback]
    P --> Q[run_scan fetches prices from MYP]
    Q --> R{Scan succeeded?}

    R -->|Yes| S[Update last_run, reset error_count]
    S --> T[Schedule stays Active]

    R -->|No| U[Increment error_count]
    U --> V{error_count >= max_retries?}
    V -->|No| W[Schedule stays Active, try again next cycle]
    V -->|Yes| X[Auto-pause schedule]
    X --> Y[User sees Paused status + red error count]

    Y --> Z[User investigates and fixes issue]
    Z --> AA[Click Resume button]
    AA --> AB[PATCH status=active]
    AB --> T

    E --> AC[Click 'Run Now' button]
    AC --> AD[trigger_now creates scan immediately]
    AD --> Q

    E --> AE[Click Delete button]
    AE --> AF{Confirm?}
    AF -->|Yes| AG[Remove from APScheduler + DB]
    AF -->|No| E

    style A fill:#22d3ee,color:#000
    style L fill:#0d9488,color:#fff
    style X fill:#ef4444,color:#fff
    style T fill:#22c55e,color:#000
